### Certificates – variabili
@baseUrl         = http://localhost:3000
@certificateId   = 1a3d7581-1c43-42b4-928d-df6792596406
@certificateCode = 313dd0bc-6170-41d9-b50f-70a33e70a3d4
@adminToken      = ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN
@studentToken    = STUDENT_JWT_TOKEN

# NOTA: La generazione del certificato avviene internamente quando
# un enrollment raggiunge il 100% di progress — non c'è POST pubblico.
# Il campo certificate_code è un UUID separato dall'id (usato per
# verifica pubblica senza esporre l'ID interno).

# ─── GET /certificates/verify/:certificate_code — PUBBLICO ───────────

### 1. Verifica autenticità certificato (endpoint pubblico, no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/certificates/verify/{{certificateCode}}

### 2. Verifica – codice inesistente (atteso 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/certificates/verify/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000999

### 3. Verifica – codice non UUID (attenzione: non usa ParseUUIDPipe qui)
GET {{baseUrl}}/certificates/verify/not-a-valid-code

# ─── GET /certificates/:id ────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4. Get certificato per ID interno
GET {{baseUrl}}/certificates/{{certificateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 5. Get certificato – ID inesistente (atteso 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/certificates/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000999
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 6. Get certificato – UUID non valido (atteso 400, ParseUUIDPipe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/certificates/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

# ─── PATCH /certificates/:id/revoke ──────────────────────────────────

### 7. Revoca certificato valido (richiede admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/certificates/{{certificateId}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Revoca – certificato già revocato (atteso 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/certificates/{{certificateId}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. Revoca – ID inesistente (atteso 404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/certificates/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000999/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. Revoca – UUID non valido (atteso 400, ParseUUIDPipe)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/certificates/not-a-uuid/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
